## Products

### Bark Phone
- [Bark Phone](https://www.bark.us/bark-phone): A smartphone for kids with built-in parental controls, monitoring, and safety features. Parents can manage screen time, block apps, and receive alerts for concerning content.

### Bark Smartwatch
- [Bark Watch](https://www.bark.us/bark-watch): A Samsung Galaxy Watch8-based kids smartwatch with talk and text over LTE, GPS location tracking, SOS emergency calling, and automatic content monitoring — with no games, social media, or web browser. Gives kids independence while keeping parents connected.

### Bark App
- [Bark App](https://www.bark.us/app): Bark Premium monitors texts, email, YouTube, and 30+ apps/social platforms for potential risks. It also provides screen time management, app blocking, and website filtering.

### Bark Home
- [Bark Home](https://www.bark.us/bark-home): A device that plugs into the home Wi-Fi router, providing filtering and screen time controls for every internet-connected device in the household.

### Bark Sync
- [Bark Sync](https://www.bark.us/bark-sync): A smart charger for iOS families that brings Bark's content monitoring to a child's iPhone or iPad, alerting parents to potential concerns like bullying, predators, and explicit content. It requires a Bark app subscription and works only with iOS, complementing Bark's app-based monitoring rather than standing alone.

---

## Core Features
- **Content Monitoring:** AI scans texts, emails, and social media for issues such as cyberbullying, adult content, depression, online predators, violence, and more. Parents receive alerts with context and expert guidance.
- **Screen Time Management:** Customize daily schedules, set limits, or pause the internet.
- **App & Website Blocking:** Block specific apps or entire categories of websites, including adult content.
- **Location Sharing:** Real-time location updates, alerts for arrivals/departures, and check-ins.
- **Privacy Balance:** Bark alerts parents only when an issue is detected, rather than showing all messages, helping build trust between parents and children.

